<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Franklin Resources starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Nigel Dally initiated coverage of Franklin Resources Inc as a neutral</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $3.20 per share for 1997 and $3.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- said the stock could hit $60 in 12 months. Shares fell 3/4 to 52-1/4.</p>
</text>
